# Deny by default: application source, required release inputs, README and its images only.
# Audit/test/capture utilities belong in the private project devtools/ directory, not Git.
# Add only exact necessary files to source-manifest.json and this allowlist.
# Private/agent state (.codex, .agents, .claude, AGENTS.md), .env files, keys,
# profiles, databases, logs, captures, caches, environments and builds stay out.
# These rules do not scrub already-tracked files or historical Git objects.
*

# Traversable source directories; their other contents remain ignored.
!/media/
!/media/screenshots/
!/packaging/
!/packaging/branding/
!/packaging/licenses/
